sequenceDiagram
    participant dbt
    participant Source as source table
    participant Target as {{ this }}

    Note over dbt: First run<br/>(full refresh)
    dbt->>Target: CREATE TABLE AS<br/>(all rows from source)
    Target-->>dbt: 1,000,000 rows inserted

    Note over dbt: Second run<br/>(incremental)
    dbt->>Source: SELECT * WHERE updated_at > (max from target)
    Source-->>dbt: 50,000 new/updated rows
    dbt->>dbt: is_incremental() == TRUE

    alt strategy: merge
        dbt->>Target: MERGE INTO target<br/>USING source ON unique_key<br/>WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE<br/>WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT
        Target-->>dbt: 50,000 rows merged
    else strategy: append
        dbt->>Target: INSERT INTO target SELECT ...
        Target-->>dbt: 50,000 rows appended
    else strategy: delete+insert
        dbt->>Target: DELETE WHERE updated_at < (new max)
        dbt->>Target: INSERT new rows
    end
